{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-03", "pageid": 110907, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-02\" title=\"三重赋格-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-04\" title=\"三重赋格-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.9D.89.E8.9C.95.E7.9A.84.E8.B0.B5.E5.A6.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蝉蜕的谵妄\">蝉蜕的谵妄</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 蝉蜕的谵妄</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Delirium of the Dying</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铁锹交叠起落，一捧捧土被扬上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>永远闭上眼睛的面庞们在一边等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>难得的平静，你真的要用来和我一起安葬遗体吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>我也不只是在帮你——我昨天就让你别废这些话跟我客气了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>你选了个不错的地方做墓地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>这一带还没有交过火，像个真正的夏天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但是，之后的战线有可能会蔓延过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>那你安葬的士兵可能会和炮火一起蒸发，或者重新裸露出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>就像泥土或者……那个叫什么来着？蝉蜕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是，蝉蜕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>没事，等到炮火再停息，我会再来，把他们重新安葬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>那你的活算是永远也做不完了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我并不介意这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>唉！那我还是更愿意想想我要怎么偷只烤鹅吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>曾有人问过我为什么要做这些，但你从来不问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>没什么好问的，卡戎。新兵在拿脑袋磕防空洞的墙，老兵在到处找卷烟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>能活着就不错了，谁还问什么意义？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……的确。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎停下动作，他看见了远处提着医疗包向这里走来的女性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树木掩映，将人形与阴影糅杂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但是有些人必须寻找意义，否则就没法生活下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>哪儿来的护士小姑娘？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>你好，小姐，你认识我们的卡戎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>是的，弗兰兹先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意料之外的称呼让弗兰兹摸了摸下巴，而女性已经重新将目光放到卡戎身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我要跟着你一起埋葬士兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这很危险，而且野战医院还有三天就要撤离，这几天应该非常忙碌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>沃尔克中校准许了我来帮你，因为你总是会挖出一息尚存但急需治疗的士兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>那确实没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎垂下头，无声地继续手上的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你不擅长撒谎，所以你只能对瓦尔特的死闭口不谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你不愿意告诉我，但是为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他死于炮击，尘土飞扬，生命顷刻蒸发的炮击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你就是在隐瞒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性的笃定让卡戎不知如何作答，因此他依然沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>以前你只是逃避问题，现在你是直接不说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>小姐，卡戎的反应比较迟缓，或许他只是在消化你的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性面无表情地撂下医疗包，拾起了一旁的铲子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你现在只喜欢做行动派了，是吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>感到棘手的弗兰兹也选择了沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我会一直跟着你做这些，直到你告诉我真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>没有什么真相，帕蒂塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>看来这件事对现在的我们来说没什么好谈的，还是干活吧，行动派。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼看坟墓成型，女性站起身走向推车，弗兰兹跟了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们配合得当地抬起了遗体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声咳嗽响起，微弱但突兀。三人面面相觑，帕蒂塔看向一边的推车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>等等，等等……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性在推车上的诸多面孔中找到其中一个，然后翻开了他的眼睑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>……该死，他还活着……他还活着！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>老天……这次不是已经检查过了吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性冲向了她的医疗包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>快把他身上的人挪开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>弗兰兹，你别磕碰他，小心有骨折。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>保罗！你愣着做什么，快来帮忙啊！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在笔记的前几页，卡戎几乎是立刻想起了那些字句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>来了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大难不死的伤兵已经得到了妥善的安置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎独自站在成排的担架和病床前，伤兵们的哀嚎环绕在他的四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔忙碌的身影消失在围帘那边，弗兰兹向卡戎打了个手势，示意他去忙自己的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎不愿细看周遭伤兵的伤口，他向弗兰兹点过头，正要抬脚——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>保罗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只嶙峋的手挥过卡戎的衣摆，却又无力地垂向地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>保罗，天呐，我终于等到一个认识的人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-528920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>威利呢？你快去把他找来，他不知道我在野战医院里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵从喉咙里挤出干涩的语言，他的识别牌上写着一串名字：法比安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你是法比安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>保罗，不要对我说这样生分的话，我也变成医院里难以辨认的病人了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎是太久没有遇到熟人，士兵变得喋喋不休，且有些异样的亢奋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>不管怎么样，安娜一定会认出我，我只需要申请退役，然后和她一起回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>安娜说再见我时，要拿金雀花给我做一个花环……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>法比安，你刚刚说你要找谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>安娜！我要见安娜，给她写一封信，她一定会来见我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>不，我是说更早的那个名字，应该是你在前线的兄弟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>我就是要见安娜呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎尝试理清他话语中的逻辑，路过的军医扫了一眼卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>你还是不要太把他的话放在心上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这是什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>他每天都在胡言乱语，伤口恢复得也很糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>截掉了一条腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>你们为什么非要避着我说话？医生！你不要再胡乱说我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-528901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">法比安：</div><div>保罗，不要听他的，他总说我疯了，说我没有对他喊长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他没有胡乱说你，法比安，我们在讲医院今天的午餐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病人惴惴不安的目光落下去，他喃喃低语着什么，卡戎转过头，压低声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那他还有机会活下来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生似乎已经在为自己多余的关心而不耐烦，他低头看了眼病历本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>不好说，三天后医院撤离到后方，他就可以得到更好的治疗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>但是，如果在那之前恶化，他就只能被留下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>留下他，和几支镇痛剂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>是的，我们都在为撤离做准备，说实话，我认为他很难撑到那天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>……或许我这样说有些直白，但死亡在这里就是这么常见又悄无声息。只是病床空了又满，没人要的牌子扔得到处都是，仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生用病历本指了指法比安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>你可以来送他一程，不过你应该会送每个被留下的人吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>法比安那仿佛无边无际的喃喃声渐渐微弱，他突然急促地呼吸了几声，犹如哽咽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的，我会。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-03"}}